#
# Counter-example for math:ExtendedRealShape: a signed-extended-real slot holding a
# non-numeric string instead of a finite number or one of the two poles. The object of
# math:extendedRealValue satisfies none of the three sh:or arms, so validation MUST emit
# shacl.OrConstraintComponent (and no other finding). A pole written as text is not a
# point of ℝ̄ (math:MalformedExtendedReal).
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecExtendedRealMalformed).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:brokenReach math:extendedRealValue "minus infinity" .
